Subject: [PATCH] mac80211: introduce ieee80211_beacon_get_tim()
From: Johannes Berg <johannes@sipsolutions.net>
To: John Linville <linville@tuxdriver.com>
Cc: linux-wireless <linux-wireless@vger.kernel.org>
